###
GET {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/swagger



### =========================================================
### Filtro 1 - Filtro vazio (retorna todas as receitas)
### Esperado: Panqueca Americana, Spaghetti à Carbonara, Bolo de Cenoura
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
}

### =========================================================
### Filtro 2 - Buscar por título
### Esperado: Panqueca Americana
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "recipeTitle_Ingredient": "Panqueca"
}

### =========================================================
### Filtro 3 - Buscar por ingrediente
### Esperado: Bolo de Cenoura
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "recipeTitle_Ingredient": "cenoura"
}

### =========================================================
### Filtro 4 - Filtrar por tempo de preparo
### Esperado: Panqueca Americana
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "cookingTimes": [1]
}

### =========================================================
### Filtro 5 - Filtrar por múltiplos tempos
### Esperado: Panqueca Americana, Spaghetti à Carbonara
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "cookingTimes": [1,2]
}

### =========================================================
### Filtro 6 - Filtrar por dificuldade fácil
### Esperado: Panqueca Americana
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "difficulties": [0]
}

### =========================================================
### Filtro 7 - Filtrar por dificuldade média
### Esperado: Spaghetti à Carbonara, Bolo de Cenoura
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "difficulties": [1]
}

### =========================================================
### Filtro 8 - Filtrar por tipo de prato
### Esperado: Spaghetti à Carbonara
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "dishTypes": [1]
}

### =========================================================
### Filtro 9 - Filtrar por múltiplos tipos de prato
### Esperado: Bolo de Cenoura
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "dishTypes": [4,5]
}

### =========================================================
### Filtro 10 - Filtro combinado (tempo + dificuldade)
### Esperado: Spaghetti à Carbonara
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "cookingTimes": [2],
  "difficulties": [1]
}

### =========================================================
### Filtro 11 - Filtro combinado com texto
### Esperado: Bolo de Cenoura com Cobertura de Chocolate
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "recipeTitle_Ingredient": "chocolate",
  "cookingTimes": [3],
  "difficulties": [1],
  "dishTypes": [4]
}

### =========================================================
### Filtro 12 - Busca que não retorna resultados
### Esperado: lista vazia
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "recipeTitle_Ingredient": "frango"
}

### =========================================================
### Filtro 13 - Combinação impossível
### Esperado: lista vazia
### =========================================================
POST {{MyRecipeBookAPI_HostAddress}}/recipe/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: pt-BR
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "cookingTimes": [0],
  "difficulties": [2],
  "dishTypes": [6]
}

